  "title": "Lithium Americas Reports First Quarter 2026 Results",
  "summary": "(All amounts in US$ unless otherwise indicated) Lithium Americas Corp. (TSX: LAC) (NYSE: LAC) (“ Lithium Americas ” or the “ Company ”) announced that it has filed its Quarterly Report on Form 10-Q, which includes the Company’s unaudited condensed consolidated interim financial statements (“ Financials ”) for the three months ended March 31, 2026 (“ Q1 2026 ”), and provided an update on its Thacker Pass lithium project in Humboldt County, Nevada (“ Thacker Pass ” or the “ Project ”). Ironworkers",
